{"title":"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 19","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sum of an infinite geometric series with common ratio <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/8/318e44029533122ca0079bcdcc32e5fadbbaf38b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|r|&lt;1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"51\" height=\"18\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/9/f1965fae079a9ba2c0726c307070c2355dfcb213.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, and the sum of the squares of the terms of this series is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/7/f27da4fca6f3fecb215974023aad210b70ec3857.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$45$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. The first term of the series is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/5/0a5802eaf0cedea6c68950782b46ab8d7acb0eeb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 12\\quad \\textbf{(B) } 10\\quad \\textbf{(C) } 5\\quad \\textbf{(D) } 3\\quad \\textbf{(E) 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"305\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We know that the formula for the sum of an infinite geometric series is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/a/4aac549850e9534c27b2a6eabccc5406e5a975ac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S = \\frac{a}{1-r}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"79\" height=\"33\" />.\n</p><p>So we can apply this to the conditions given by the problem. \n</p><p>We have two equations:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/5/495693e01efa0d5edd332f1a8d1a800fd63e0819.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} 15 &amp;= \\frac{a}{1-r} \\\\ 45 &amp;= \\frac{a^{2}}{1-r^{2}} \\end{align*}\" width=\"91\" height=\"80\" />\n</p><p>We get\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/4/504cf4b15fd18c6136feddc670c6f198950a51a3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} a &amp;= 15 - 15r \\\\ a^{2} &amp;= 45 - 45r^{2} \\\\ \\\\ (15 - 15r)^{2} &amp;= 45 - 45r^{2} \\\\ 270r^{2} - 450r + 180 &amp;= 0 \\\\ 3r^{2} - 5r + 2 &amp;= 0 \\\\ (3r - 2)(r - 1) &amp;= 0 \\end{align*}\" width=\"248\" height=\"177\" />\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/7/a971899b2ffa5e1c294738908afeec48137ac5ab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|r| &lt; 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"54\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/b/c2baf01915b645bf3bc79754d1f5903d180d8e37.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r = \\frac{2}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"44\" height=\"37\" />, so plug this into the equation above and we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/7/1d7feb398025ba4922e117eaa17b0588d21f23b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 15 - 15r = 15 - 10 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)} \\quad 5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"274\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p>Solution by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/4/134d9ee223dce21c41195abd33c8c88f55f4a1d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\underline{\\textbf{Invoker}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"63\" height=\"15\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME\" title=\"1970 AHSME\">1970 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1970 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1970\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">Problem 20</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1970 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1970_AHSME_Problems/P